From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Flysoft <flysoftbeta@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 11:16:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 30/33] Preserve Chromium copyright attribution in PRTS branded
 resources

Rebrand application-facing text while retaining the original author and copyright notices.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/chrome/app/chromium_strings.grd b/chrome/app/chromium_strings.grd
index 48c69522db..b05e3b57fc 100644
--- a/chrome/app/chromium_strings.grd
+++ b/chrome/app/chromium_strings.grd
@@ -515,10 +515,10 @@ New bookmarks can’t be saved in your account until you delete some. If you sig
         </then>
         <else>
           <message name="IDS_ABOUT_VERSION_COMPANY_NAME" desc="Company name on the about pages">
-            The PRTS Authors
+            The Chromium Authors
           </message>
           <message name="IDS_ABOUT_VERSION_COPYRIGHT" desc="Copyright information on the about pages">
-            Copyright <ph name="YEAR">{0,date,y}<ex>2016</ex></ph> The PRTS Authors. All rights reserved.
+            Copyright <ph name="YEAR">{0,date,y}<ex>2016</ex></ph> The Chromium Authors. All rights reserved.
           </message>
         </else>
       </if>
